[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.360]   Bahaya angin! AI nggak cuma ngasih tahu
[00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.420]   tombol mana yang harus diklik, tapi
[00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:06.440]   bisa klik dan ngetik di aplikasi
[00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.080]   desktop.
[00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:09.560]   Nah, ada tool open source bernama Agent
[00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.800]   Desktop, Proyek Diversal Labs.
[00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.490]   Tapi menariknya, ini bukan model AI
[00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.480]   baru, dan bukan agent yang bekerja sendirian.
[00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.610]   Agent yang memakainya tetap mengatur
[00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:20.080]   langkah.
[00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.140]   Lewat fitur aksesibilitas, tool ini
[00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.290]   bisa membaca tombol dan menu yang
[00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.760]   memang disediakan aplikasi.
[00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.240]   Jadi alurnya simple, baca antar muka,
[00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.000]   kirim tindakan, lalu cek lagi hasilnya.
[00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.320]   Tapi jangan salah, nggak semua aplikasi
[00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:34.120]   didukung.
[00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.600]   Agent tiap sistem juga berbeda, dan tindakan
[00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.670]   yang terkirim belum tentu berarti tugasnya
[00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:39.400]   selesai.
[00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.700]   Bahkan snapshot dan log bisa memuat
[00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:42.840]   data pribadi.
[00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.790]   Kalau AI mendapat akses ke komputer
[00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:47.560]   kamu, bagian apa yang paling wajib dibatasi?
